{"step_index":91,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-21T20:49:09Z","thinking":"Initial observation: the project directory is empty. Reviewing the `task.md` file reveals the project phases and required files, starting with project setup and progressing through training, rebranding, export, and evaluation. This suggests a structured approach to the project's development.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"[build-system]\\nrequires = [\\\"setuptools>=61.0\\\"]\\nbuild-backend = \\\"setuptools.build_meta\\\"\\n\\n[project]\\nname = \\\"smartagent\\\"\\nversion = \\\"0.1.0\\\"\\ndescription = \\\"SmartAGENT - AI-Powered Cybersecurity Vulnerability Scanner & Fluxnat Coder 3B Training Suite\\\"\\nreadme = \\\"README.md\\\"\\nrequires-python = \\\">=3.10\\\"\\nlicense = { text = \\\"Apache-2.0\\\" }\\nauthors = [\\n    { name = \\\"Fluxnat Team\\\" }\\n]\\nkeywords = [\\\"cybersecurity\\\", \\\"vulnerability-scanner\\\", \\\"llm\\\", \\\"code-analysis\\\", \\\"sast\\\", \\\"fine-tuning\\\"]\\n\\ndependencies = [\\n    \\\"torch>=2.1.0\\\",\\n    \\\"transformers>=4.45.0\\\",\\n    \\\"accelerate>=0.34.0\\\",\\n    \\\"bitsandbytes>=0.43.0\\\",\\n    \\\"peft>=0.12.0\\\",\\n    \\\"trl>=0.11.0\\\",\\n    \\\"datasets>=3.0.0\\\",\\n    \\\"typer[all]>=0.12.0\\\",\\n    \\\"rich>=13.8.0\\\",\\n    \\\"pydantic>=2.8.0\\\",\\n    \\\"requests>=2.31.0\\\",\\n    \\\"pyyaml>=6.0.1\\\",\\n    \\\"huggingface-hub>=0.25.0\\\",\\n]\\n\\n[project.optional-dependencies]\\ndev = [\\n    \\\"pytest>=8.0.0\\\",\\n    \\\"ruff>=0.6.0\\\",\\n]\\ntraining = [\\n    \\\"unsloth\\\",\\n    \\\"wandb>=0.17.0\\\",\\n    \\\"scipy\\\",\\n]\\n\\n[project.scripts]\\nsmartagent = \\\"smartagent.cli:app\\\"\\n\\n[tool.setuptools.packages.find]\\nwhere = [\\\".\\\"]\\ninclude = [\\\"smartagent*\\\"]\\n\"","Description":"\"Create pyproject.toml with project metadata, dependencies for training and inference\"","Overwrite":"tr